  pvr_bo.[ch], pvr_device.h,        a device cache of freed buffer objects:
  pvr_arch_device.c                 command buffers allocate and free them
                                    as they record and reset (control
                                    streams, descriptor and uniform uploads
                                    through the sub-allocators, SPM
                                    constants), dozens per WebGL frame, each
