  pco/pco_nir.c                     buffer loads are vectorized before the
                                    robustness lowering. Zink loads every
                                    32-bit component of a GL uniform on its
                                    own (its UBOs are uint arrays) and enables
                                    robustBufferAccess; the lowering made each
                                    offset a bcsel, after which nothing
                                    merged, so every component was an ld and
                                    a wdf of its own, a serialized memory
